# Import Order (SHM)

Use this project’s **@/** alias for anything under `src/`. Do not use deep relative paths like `../../../components`.

**Order and groups (blank line between groups):**

```tsx
// React & hooks
import { useState } from "react";
import { HashRouter, Routes, Route } from "react-router-dom";

// External libraries
import { someLib } from "some-lib";

// Internal (@/ = src/)
import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button";
import { apiClient, API_ENDPOINTS } from "@/api";
import { cn } from "@/utils";
import type { SomeType } from "@/types";

// Relative (same feature/folder)
import { validate } from "./utils";
import type { FormData } from "./types";

// Styles (last)
import "@/styles/index.css";
import styles from "./MyComponent.module.css";
```

**Rules:**

- Use **@/** alias for all src imports (Vite/tsconfig map `@` → `src`).
- No `../../../components` or similar; use `@/components/...`.
- Blank line between each group.
